    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While you are an enemy inside <strong data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"453\">Shadow Raid</strong>, all creatures are concealed to you. You must succeed at a <strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"532\">DC 5 flat check</strong> when targeting a creature with an attack, spell, or other non-area effect.</p><p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"773\">If you successfully disbelieve Shadow Raid, the shadows no longer impede your vision and you take half damage from the spell for the remainder of its duration.</p>",
